-- Site Materials Management — UPGRADE for an existing project
-- Use this if you already ran the original setup.sql (tables from migrations 0001–0004).
-- Adds: procurement & cost control (0005), site diary / inspections / snags / concrete /
-- rebar (0006), gate passes / alerts / QR / Telegram / Amharic & Ethiopian calendar (0007).
-- Paste into Supabase Dashboard → SQL Editor → Run, once.
-- Generated by supabase/build-sql.mjs — do not edit.
